{"id": "70446", "title": "刺青", "author": "苏鎏", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 32, "available": 12, "cover": "files/article/image/70/70446/70446s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/70/70446.htm", "intro": "本文原名《上位》，因某个那啥啥的原因现在改成叫《刺青》，内容不变，敬请谅解。\n    他是刻在她骨血上的刺青。\n    第一次见面，是她父母死的那天。\n    第二次见面，她成了他儿子的未婚妻。\n    只有他们自己知道，十七年前的那件事情，令他们的关系变得错综复杂、扑朔迷离。\n    本文1V1，HE。", "base": "files/article/html/70/70446", "chapters": [{"title": "正文", "volume": true}, {"title": "初见", "file": "10971598.html", "available": false}, {"title": "一家人", "file": "10971599.html", "available": false}, {"title": "目的", "file": "10971600.html", "available": false}, {"title": "告别", "file": "10971601.html", "available": false}, {"title": "演戏", "file": "10971602.html", "available": false}, {"title": "天真", "file": "10971603.html", "available": false}, {"title": "献殷勤", "file": "10971604.html", "available": false}, {"title": "一日游", "file": "10971605.html", "available": false}, {"title": "试探", "file": "10971606.html", "available": false}, {"title": "交易", "file": "10971607.html", "available": false}, {"title": "好感", "file": "10971608.html", "available": false}, {"title": "生病", "file": "10971609.html", "available": false}, {"title": "撒娇", "file": "10971610.html", "available": false}, {"title": "压迫感", "file": "10971611.html", "available": false}, {"title": "天注定", "file": "10971612.html", "available": false}, {"title": "受伤", "file": "10971613.html", "available": false}, {"title": "吃醋", "file": "10971614.html", "available": false}, {"title": "凝视", "file": "10971615.html", "available": false}, {"title": "福气", "file": "10971616.html", "available": false}, {"title": "圣诞", "file": "10971617.html", "available": false}, {"title": "情敌", "file": "10971618.html", "available": true}, {"title": "入V公告", "file": "10971619.html", "available": true}, {"title": "23-30", "file": "10971620.html", "available": true}, {"title": "31-37", "file": "10971621.html", "available": true}, {"title": "38-46", "file": "10971622